SUMMARY:
This document serves as the formal architectural blueprint to decouple state-level data infrastructure from fragile, geographically restricted silicon processing pipelines. By eliminating dependency on standard commercial silicon semiconductors, SSAC maps an independent pathway to high-performance, waterless compute arrays.

LEGAL PROVISIONS ENFORCED:
